    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immerse Yourself in a World of Horror and Mystery</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>STATIC</strong>, you step into the shoes of Clara, an ordinary young woman whose life takes a terrifying turn after a seemingly harmless evening watching television. What begins as a quiet night at home quickly descends into a nightmare as Clara finds herself temporarily trapped in a twisted dimension within her own TV. After escaping back to reality, Clara realizes that this was only the beginning of her ordeal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565120/extras/d048d2e2a52cf9ce30b0f5e34a44ee3e.poster.avif?t=1744320868\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565120/extras/d048d2e2a52cf9ce30b0f5e34a44ee3e.webm?t=1744320868\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565120/extras/d048d2e2a52cf9ce30b0f5e34a44ee3e.mp4?t=1744320868\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Exploration</strong>: Navigate through a beautifully crafted Moroccan riad, rendered in stunning detail, where every shadow and flicker of light can hide a new horror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565120/extras/48e55916fc029a3d4a2119aa33a7649a.poster.avif?t=1744320868\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565120/extras/48e55916fc029a3d4a2119aa33a7649a.webm?t=1744320868\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565120/extras/48e55916fc029a3d4a2119aa33a7649a.mp4?t=1744320868\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engaging Storyline\u00a0</strong>: Unravel the mysteries of Clara's predicament through an immersive narrative that combines psychological horror with elements of suspense and lore.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chilling Encounters</strong> : Face off against terrifying monsters and sinister cult members who will test your wits and courage at every turn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565120/extras/c5dc2a4832669bba4ef4b4ac676758c2.poster.avif?t=1744320868\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565120/extras/c5dc2a4832669bba4ef4b4ac676758c2.webm?t=1744320868\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565120/extras/c5dc2a4832669bba4ef4b4ac676758c2.mp4?t=1744320868\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzles and Challenges</strong> : Solve intricate puzzles to unlock new areas and uncover hidden secrets that will help you piece together the story.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Sound Design</strong> : Experience a haunting soundtrack and sound effects that enhance the eerie atmosphere and keep you on the edge of your seat.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Stunning Visuals</strong> : Enjoy high-quality graphics that bring the eerie beauty of the riad and its dark, twisted versions to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565120/extras/d8e7b114631460b2a4101ac1e7b2d36e.poster.avif?t=1744320868\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565120/extras/d8e7b114631460b2a4101ac1e7b2d36e.webm?t=1744320868\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565120/extras/d8e7b114631460b2a4101ac1e7b2d36e.mp4?t=1744320868\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Story:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clara thought it was just another night in front of the TV. But when the screen begins to show her own house and the boundaries between reality and the screen blur, she is pulled into a world where nothing is as it seems. After battling her way out of this twisted dimension, Clara discovers that her nightmare is far from over. As she faces new horrors and uncovers deeper conspiracies, she must confront a sinister cult that has far-reaching plans for her and her world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you help Clara uncover the truth and escape the horrors that await, or will she be lost to the darkness forever?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Why Play STATIC : THE BEGINNING?</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>For Fans of Psychological Horror\u00a0</strong>: If you love games that combine deep storytelling with intense, atmospheric horror, <strong>STATIC : THE BEGINNING</strong> is for you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Setting\u00a0</strong>: Explore a Moroccan riad, a setting rarely seen in horror games, brought to life with incredible attention to detail.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replayability\u00a0</strong>: Multiple endings and hidden secrets ensure that each playthrough offers something new.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immerse Yourself in a World of Horror and Mystery</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>STATIC</strong>, you step into the shoes of Clara, an ordinary young woman whose life takes a terrifying turn after a seemingly harmless evening watching television. What begins as a quiet night at home quickly descends into a nightmare as Clara finds herself temporarily trapped in a twisted dimension within her own TV. After escaping back to reality, Clara realizes that this was only the beginning of her ordeal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565120/extras/d048d2e2a52cf9ce30b0f5e34a44ee3e.poster.avif?t=1744320868\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565120/extras/d048d2e2a52cf9ce30b0f5e34a44ee3e.webm?t=1744320868\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565120/extras/d048d2e2a52cf9ce30b0f5e34a44ee3e.mp4?t=1744320868\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Exploration</strong>: Navigate through a beautifully crafted Moroccan riad, rendered in stunning detail, where every shadow and flicker of light can hide a new horror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565120/extras/48e55916fc029a3d4a2119aa33a7649a.poster.avif?t=1744320868\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565120/extras/48e55916fc029a3d4a2119aa33a7649a.webm?t=1744320868\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shar